Z||000002||dogtired||06-12-2000||03:54 AM||||Everyone:<BR>Cliff and BatBoy have something here.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Not long ago at all I was in the hospital, a real pain in the BACK. You folks here sent me several personal E-Mails, off Forum, and you do not have any Idea how good it makes one feel to get direct corespondance from Forum FRIENDS.  You folks went out of your way and took the time to send a little sunshine (Fiero Exhaust) my way. I can't say thanks enough to all that helped lift my spirits and at times just gave me a little chuckle.<BR>So As BatBoy suggested. You all ought to drop him a line. Maybe an off colored joke? (maybe not?)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> or just something you think would put a smile on his face.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Just my opinion, I know you all were there to support me, and I can't say THANKS enough.<P>Now to go and look up Orge's address.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I hope it is correct in his profile.<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000003||theogre||06-12-2000||08:46 PM||||according to current plan I should only be here a couple more days while the cumadin switch over happens. So if I gave you the address I'd likely be gone before things got here. They are telling be I'll be home wednesday, thursday latest, if things continue at the current rate. The Chemo will then be done out patient.<P>I think the profile e-mail works. Cliff has it, but here it is just to make sure you all do.<P>theogre@sprynet.com<P>I don't want my home address to fall into a spam pit, I won't just stick in a post. Cliff already has it. (It's the newark address cliff)he can give it to any who wish to send hard mail. (To bad I can't drink my martini Fiero even if you sent it now. no booze with chemo.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> ) ||||reg||1
